      "text": "Carriers have weaponized \"Blank Sailings.\" 🛠️\n\nPost-Golden Week, we are seeing the most aggressive capacity management since the pandemic. By canceling voyages at the first sign of softening, carriers are artificially tightening a market that \"should\" be in freefall.",
